                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{B}
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msup
                        %mi ℝ
                        %mrow
                          %msub
                            %mi k
                            %mi i
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}^{k_i}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartesian+product"} Cartesian product
              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/direct+sum+of+vector+bundles"} direct sum of vector bundles
              of the separate normal bundles bulled back to the product manifold. In the notation of prop.
